---
title: "open_obligation - Create Obligation with HotPotato Pattern (Scallop Lend)"
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> q_check_version: check version == current_version
    q_check_version --> q_error_version: version mismatch
    q_error_version --> [*]: abort error
    q_check_version --> q_create_obligation: version matches
    q_create_obligation --> q_create_key: obligation = new Obligation(empty collaterals, empty debts)
    q_create_key --> q_create_hotpotato: obligation_key = new ObligationKey(obligation.id)
    q_create_hotpotato --> [*]: return (Obligation, ObligationKey, ObligationHotPotato)

    note right of q_create_obligation
        INV-001: each Obligation has exactly one matching ObligationKey
        INV-002: ObligationHotPotato must be consumed in same PTB via return_obligation
        INV-003: new Obligation has zero collateral and zero debt
    end note
